Local correction: src/base/write/entry_stream.rs returns compressed and
uncompressed sizes in the correct order when force_no_zip64 is enabled.
The upstream tuple was reversed, corrupting central-directory records and
data descriptors for compressed streamed entries.

Regression coverage lives in narou_rs transfer streaming tests and uses an
independent ZIP reader plus direct central-directory/data-descriptor checks.

Local resource accounting: ZipFileWriter exposes retained record count,
capacity, record size, and fallible exact reservation. Callers can admit
central-directory metadata (including old/new allocation overlap) before
growing it; entry payload streaming and archive semantics are unchanged.
